## 13. CORE USER WORKFLOWS

Implement the following complete flows.

### Workflow A: Job Seeker Registration

Registration → Role Selection → Personal Information → Profile Creation → Skill Selection → Academic Information → Document Upload → Verification Submission → Dashboard.

Users should be able to access the platform while verification is pending, but clearly distinguish unverified from verified accounts.

### Workflow B: Employer Registration

Registration → Employer Role → Business Information → Employer Verification → Dashboard → Create Job → Publish → Receive Applications.

### Workflow C: Direct Job Matching

Job Seeker Profile → Matching Engine → Recommended Jobs → Job Details → Apply → Employer Notification → Employer Review → Shortlisting → Interview → Selection.

### Workflow D: Micro-Task Hiring

Employer Creates Task → Task Published → Matching Candidates → Candidates Express Interest → Employer Selects Worker → Work Begins → Completion Confirmation → Review.

### Workflow E: Document Verification

Document Upload → Secure Storage → Pending Verification → Admin Review → Approve / Reject / Request Resubmission → User Notification → Updated Profile Status.

Every workflow must have appropriate loading, success, failure, and empty states.

